    <briefdescription>
<para>Machine learning-based anomaly detector for observability metrics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Combines time-series forecasting (ARIMA / Prophet-style Holt-Winters), outlier detection (Isolation Forest / LOF), DBSCAN density checks, seasonal pattern recognition, and lightweight change-point detection. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
